== Trivia ==
* Magic Mushroom does not give a [[Tears]], [[Luck]], or [[Shot Speed]] increase despite its quote saying 'All Stats Up!'.
* This item and its effects are a reference to the Super Mushroom from the [[wikipedia:Super Mario Brothers|''Super Mario Brothers'']] video game franchise.
* This item's sprite resembles to the mushroom species [[wikipedia:Amanita muscaria|''Amanita muscaria'']], fly agaric.
* 'Magic mushrooms' is a colloquial term for hallucinogenic mushrooms containing psilocybin. Fly agaric is hallucinogenic, although it does not contain psilocybin and is not considered a "magic mushroom".
* {{dlc|a+}} This item is one of the only two ({{dlc|r}} five/ {{dlc|r+}} six) in the game that work towards 2 transformations ({{tf|Stompy}} and {{tf|Fun Guy}}), the other ones being {{i|The Bible}}, {{i|Hive Mind|r}}, {{i|Parasitoid|r}}, {{I|Skatole|r}}, {{dlc|r+}} and {{i|The Necronomicon}}.
* This item shares a retro pickup sound effect with {{i|1up!}}.
* Magic Mushroom, along with {{i|1up!}}, {{i|Mini Mush}}, {{i|Super Bandage}}, and {{i|Mega Mush}} is one of the few items that make a unique sound upon pickup.

